      "purposeInStoryline": "This is Lesson 1 of the unit. It opens the anchoring phenomenon — the parabolic arc of a shot put thrown on a Nairobi school sports day — and establishes the central puzzle: linear equations cannot describe this curve. Every subsequent lesson technique (forming expressions, factorising, solving equations) will be motivated by the need to decode and predict this curve. This lesson plants the seed for the entire Driving Question Board and returns to the phenomenon at every phase.",
